@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Tabs}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Tabs @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</PageTitle>

<h1>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Tabs @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</h1>

<p>
    Tabs is a simple component that organises content into separate sections (tab panels), each accessible via a clickable tab.
</p>

<p>
    Below is an example of the tabs component in a section with a heading of "Lifestyle Tabs" which is used to give the tabs an accessible name via the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">aria-labelledby</span> attribute.
    You can also set the component to use an <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">aria-label</span> attribute when its not possible to use the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">aria-labelledby</span> attribute.
</p>
<p>
The following example of the Tabs component has its <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">AutoActivatePanel</span> parameter set to false, which means when using the keyboard you first set focus on a tab using the 
    <kbd>Left Arrow</kbd> or <kbd>Right Arrow</kbd> keys., and then use the <kbd>Enter or Space</kbd> key to activate it (show the panel);
</p>

<section class="@Section.Base @Section.Bordered @Section.Radius(SectionRadius.Content)" style="margin-top:var(--br-unit-space-7);">
    <h2 class="@Section.Heading.Base @Section.Heading.MobileCentred @Section.Heading.Text(SectionHeadingText.PrimaryDark)" id="lifestyle-tabs">Lifestyle Tabs</h2>
    <Tabs @bind-ActiveTabIndex="_tabindex" AriaLabelledBy="lifestyle-tabs" AutoActivatePanel="false" TabIconPosition="TabIconPosition.Left" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <Tab TabTitle="Food" SvgIcon="--svg-food-icon">
            <TabPanelContent>
                <h3>Recipes</h3>
                <p>
                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin sit amet sem vulputate, interdum justo vitae, sagittis nulla. Ut lectus augue, consectetur ut massa id,
                    tristique luctus eros. Donec tempus augue velit, vel vehicula tellus consequat vel. Integer tristique sem ac nisi sodales placerat. Integer nulla ex, tincidunt ut
                    eleifend ut, vestibulum vel leo. Proin diam urna, finibus porttitor purus nec, tristique varius justo. Nunc vel dui sed dui elementum facilisis. Curabitur ac fermentum
                    urna. Integer vestibulum fermentum massa, quis auctor elit viverra eget.
                </p>
            </TabPanelContent>
        </Tab>
        <Tab TabTitle="Travel" SvgIcon="--svg-airplane-icon">

            <TabPanelContent>
                <h3>Itinerary</h3>
                <p>
                    Nulla eu est lacus. Mauris sodales tortor in sem viverra porta. Nam in dapibus massa. Vivamus et augue quis mauris luctus pretium eu eu dolor. Maecenas gravida nisl non
                    ante facilisis, pulvinar vestibulum nibh sagittis. Pellentesque mollis sem at arcu mattis, id molestie augue cursus. Pellentesque dolor urna, ultricies quis iaculis ac,
                    rutrum luctus nulla. Integer et consequat erat. Sed eget metus in est pulvinar ultrices at nec lorem. Sed aliquam massa eget dui aliquet ullamcorper. Sed elit nisi, maximus
                    et erat molestie, bibendum rutrum diam. Phasellus cursus eleifend porta.
                </p>

            </TabPanelContent>
        </Tab>
        <Tab TabTitle="Exercise" SvgIcon="--svg-runner-icon">

            <TabPanelContent>
                <h3>Workouts</h3>
                <p>
                    Mauris imperdiet nisi nec pulvinar porta. Sed semper viverra venenatis. Sed accumsan, erat condimentum ornare malesuada, erat mauris tincidunt enim, non interdum quam sem
                    ac velit. Nunc et enim lorem. Maecenas gravida tortor eget ligula efficitur ullamcorper. Cras ut nisi elementum, maximus ante eu, vestibulum nibh. Vestibulum nec iaculis elit,
                    sit amet sagittis ex.
                </p>
            </TabPanelContent>
        </Tab>
    </Tabs>
</section>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Switch}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Usage}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Switch - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Tabs}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Installation}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Tabs - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Installation</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
@code {

    private int _tabindex = 0;

}

